WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.652 --> 00:00:33.733
Bobby opened the door to the gym.

2
00:00:33.753 --> 00:00:35.174
Jason, Nina, and Izzie were there already, ready for Kids Central.

3
00:00:35.194 --> 00:00:36.114
Miss Shelly was passing out sweatbands.

4
00:00:36.134 --> 00:00:38.976
"What are we doing today, Miss Shelly?"

5
00:00:38.996 --> 00:00:39.236
Bobby asked.

6
00:00:39.256 --> 00:00:40.277
"We are exercising," Miss Shelly answered.

7
00:00:40.297 --> 00:00:41.158
"Are we playing basketball?"

8
00:00:41.178 --> 00:00:42.439
Bobby asked excitedly.

9
00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:47.342
"We're doing a different kind of exercise," she said.

10
00:00:47.362 --> 00:00:50.864
"Today we'll exercise our brains!"

11
00:00:52.265 --> 00:00:53.626
The kids looked at each other.

12
00:00:53.646 --> 00:00:55.768
"Our brains?

13
00:00:56.288 --> 00:00:57.949
Does that mean we're doing math?"

14
00:00:58.489 --> 00:00:59.830
Nina asked, frowning.

15
00:01:01.191 --> 00:01:02.092
Bobby groaned.

16
00:01:03.169 --> 00:01:05.710
"Not quite.

17
00:01:06.211 --> 00:01:08.872
I have a bucket here full of brain teasers."

18
00:01:09.773 --> 00:01:11.814
Miss Shelly held up a bucket of cards.

19
00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.517
"Here, Nina," Miss Shelly said.

20
00:01:15.537 --> 00:01:19.800
"Pick a card and read the brain teaser to yourself.

21
00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.822
Then choose someone to answer it."

22
00:01:24.102 --> 00:01:26.324
Nina took a card and read it silently.

23
00:01:27.585 --> 00:01:28.465
Then she grinned.

24
00:01:28.485 --> 00:01:32.128
"I choose Bobby," she said.

25
00:01:33.896 --> 00:01:36.939
"How many letters are in the alphabet?"

26
00:01:37.319 --> 00:01:38.120
Nina asked.

27
00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:40.382
"That's easy.

28
00:01:40.402 --> 00:01:43.104
26," Bobby answered.

29
00:01:44.325 --> 00:01:45.726
Nina burst into giggles.

30
00:01:45.746 --> 00:01:46.567
"Nope. 11!

31
00:01:46.587 --> 00:01:48.929
T-h-e-a-l-p-h-a-b-e-t. Get it?

32
00:01:48.969 --> 00:02:02.452
That's 11!"

33
00:02:02.492 --> 00:02:03.753
She smiled at Miss Shelly.

34
00:02:03.773 --> 00:02:05.874
"This is fun."

35
00:02:05.894 --> 00:02:08.956
"Okay, Bobby, you're next.

36
00:02:09.816 --> 00:02:11.838
Pick a card," Miss Shelly said.

37
00:02:13.058 --> 00:02:14.719
Bobby took a card and read it.

38
00:02:14.739 --> 00:02:19.362
"Jason!" he said, turning to his friend.

39
00:02:19.382 --> 00:02:23.825
"What goes up but never comes down?"

40
00:02:25.405 --> 00:02:26.426
Jason shrugged.

41
00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.247
"A hot air balloon?

42
00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.282
Clouds?" "You can only have one answer!"

43
00:02:33.642 --> 00:02:34.323
Bobby said.

44
00:02:34.343 --> 00:02:37.206
"Okay, clouds."

45
00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:40.688
"Nope. Your age!"

46
00:02:41.529 --> 00:02:43.711
Bobby waved the card in front of Jason.

47
00:02:44.131 --> 00:02:49.136
"My turn," Jason said, taking a card out of the bucket.

48
00:02:49.156 --> 00:02:52.118
"Aha! This is a good one."

49
00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.020
He turned to Izzie.

50
00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:58.724
"What doesn't get any wetter, even in the rain?"

51
00:02:59.976 --> 00:03:01.217
Izzie thought for a moment.

52
00:03:01.237 --> 00:03:03.238
"An umbrella?"

53
00:03:03.699 --> 00:03:04.339
she guessed.

54
00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.301
"No. Water!"

55
00:03:07.802 --> 00:03:09.022
Jason said happily.

56
00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:12.825
"Okay. Here I go.

57
00:03:14.326 --> 00:03:17.628
Nina, what is full of holes but still holds water?"

58
00:03:18.049 --> 00:03:18.769
Izzie asked.

59
00:03:18.789 --> 00:03:25.154
"There's a hole in the bucket Nina began to sing softly.

60
00:03:25.174 --> 00:03:27.535
"A basket!"

61
00:03:27.855 --> 00:03:28.436
she cried.

62
00:03:29.956 --> 00:03:31.417
"No, but good try!

63
00:03:32.158 --> 00:03:35.441
The answer is a sponge," Izzie told her friend.

64
00:03:35.461 --> 00:03:39.544
"Miss Shelly, now it's your turn!"

65
00:03:39.985 --> 00:03:40.765
Jason said.

66
00:03:40.785 --> 00:03:43.407
"Okay. Here I go."

67
00:03:44.268 --> 00:03:48.372
Miss Shelly took a card, closed her eyes, and spun around in a circle.

68
00:03:49.693 --> 00:03:51.935
When she stopped, she was facing Bobby.

69
00:03:51.955 --> 00:03:55.357
"Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

70
00:03:55.377 --> 00:04:00.041
"The more of them you take, the more you leave behind.

71
00:04:01.522 --> 00:04:02.262
What are they?"

72
00:04:03.663 --> 00:04:04.443
Bobby thought.

73
00:04:05.984 --> 00:04:13.308
"The more of them you take, the more you leave behind," he repeated to himself.

74
00:04:13.328 --> 00:04:21.653
"I take showers I take naps I take steps Steps!

75
00:04:22.453 --> 00:04:27.836
Footsteps! That's the answer, Miss Shelly," Bobby said.

76
00:04:28.828 --> 00:04:31.009
Miss Shelly clapped her hands and laughed.

77
00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.390
"Well done!"

78
00:04:34.971 --> 00:04:35.491
she said.

79
00:04:35.511 --> 00:04:37.052
"You got it."

80
00:04:37.072 --> 00:04:41.794
"These were hard brain teasers," Nina said.

81
00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:44.395
"My head hurts!"

82
00:04:46.036 --> 00:04:49.417
"Miss Shelly, can I take home the brain-teaser bucket?"

83
00:04:49.817 --> 00:04:50.557
Bobby asked.

84
00:04:50.577 --> 00:04:55.800
"I'm going to learn every brain teaser in the world!"
